stPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ffd160f686daed1edc3a94b9502c27d","RawContent":"44 days to go, and we are FINALLY starting to get together our playlist for our Ipod wedding.. \n \n A while back Tammy put her playlist out and that really helped.. I&#039;ve tried to find more, but I only see individual song suggestions.\n \n If you wrote out your complete playlist, please respond with it. I&#039;d love to check it out! THANK YOU SO MUCH!","Attachments":[],"Id":682794,"PostDate":1241719887,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                44 days to go, and we are FINALLY starting to get together our playlist for our Ipod wedding.. <br \/> <br \/> A while back Tammy put her playlist out and that really helped.. I've tried to find more, but I only see individual song suggestions.<br \/> <br \/> If you wrote out your complete playlist, please respond with it. I'd love to check it out! THANK YOU SO MUCH!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>~Soon to be Shanny May<\/span><br><span>June 20th, 2009<\/span><br><span>Cabo San Lucas, MX<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cEXY0g410000MTAwMzM1bHN8MDE1NnN8T3VyIFdlZGRpbmcgQ291bnRkb3duISE.gif\">http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cEXY0g4100...nRkb3duISE.gif<\/a><\/div><\/div