<img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span><\/a>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">my friend at work got her dress from <a href='http:\/\/www.groupusa.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Group USA: Home<\/a>. she was so not excited to look for dresses there, but her mom was like oh lets just try it! well she ended up finding one and falling in love with it, bought it that day at the store. they do sell them online as well.<br \/> her dress<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/i224.photobucket.com\/albums\/dd184\/abbie_fitch\/BDW%20pics\/dress.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i224.photobucket.com\/albums\/dd184\/abbie_fitch\/BDW%20pics\/dress.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> wow! great prices. are the knockoffs? one dress looked familiar to me.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"morganleigh03@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.177.182.183","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1182650580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rodent","Id":207489,"Name":"rodent","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a42b7af0070870a1e63499b4fda355b","RawContent":"well, it&#039;s a real store, we have one sort of near us in a city called auburn. so i dont think they&#039;re official knock-offs, but you never know. they sell clothes, but it&#039;s sort of the type of store like a Deb or Rave, not sure if anyone knows what they are, but cheap and tacky &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; so she was really surprised that she found a dress there, and she actually loved it. she is a really picky girl and she only shops at places like gap and jcrew, so for her to be impressed is good!","Attachments":[],"Id":318213,"PostDate":1211926578,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                well, it's a real store, we have one sort of near us in a city called auburn. so i dont think they're official knock-offs, but you never know. they sell clothes, but it's sort of the type of store like a Deb or Rave, not sure if anyone knows what they are, but cheap and tacky <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> so she was really surprised that she found a dress there, and she actually loved it. she is a really picky girl and she only shops at places like gap and jcrew, so for her to be impressed is good!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abbie.chalcraft@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.147.88.43","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1194472440,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207912.jpg?_r=1386394469","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":162,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Abbie","Id":207912,"Name":"Abbie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bcd6f00ef715ee415a6bd6c51ea7e4ee","RawContent":"Hi All,\n \n Has anyone heard of Brides Against Breast Cancer? Brides donate their used dresses and the organization resells them at steep discounts--all the $ goes to fight breast cancer. A friend of mine donated her dress which was a gorgeous, designer and very expensive dress. She went to the sale to donate the her dress and said they had a great selection at great prices. Problem is, sales are only in select cities on select dates. There aren&#039;t any in my area before my wedding :-( Wish they did it online too!\n \n For those interested, here is the link: \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bridesagainstbreastcancer.org\/\"&gt;Brides Against Breast Cancer&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":319819,"PostDate":1212022419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi All,<br \/> <br \/> Has anyone heard of Brides Against Breast Cancer? Brides donate their used dresses and the organization resells them at steep discounts--all the $ goes to fight breast cancer. A friend of mine donated her dress which was a gorgeous, designer and very expensive dress. She went to the sale to donate the her dress and said they had a great selection at great prices. Problem is, sales are only in select cities on select dates. There aren't any in my area before my wedding :-( Wish they did it online too!<br \/> <br \/> For those interested, here is the link: <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bridesagainstbreastcancer.org\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Brides Against Breast Cancer<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cheng_martha@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1211283194,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209492.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"McCheng","Id":209492,"Name":"McCheng","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b7b225583b8e2f29387a732359177406","RawContent":"Good idea to have this all together - good to save time browsing when you get online at 11:00 PM every day! Thanks","Attachments":[],"Id":320014,"PostDate":1212028840,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Good idea to have this all together - good to save time browsing when you get online at 11:00 PM every day! Thanks\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>visit my wedsite @ <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/web.mac.com\/kimlemire\/Lemire_Lennon_wedsite\/How_we_Met.html\">http:\/\/web.mac.com\/kimlemire\/Lemire_...ow_we_Met.html<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;116\/st\/20090404\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/e37d\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...e37d\/event.png<\/a><br><span>28 Guests Booked so far!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kimba1177@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1201068486,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208333.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"S2BLennon","Id":208333,"Name":"S2BLennon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eae3a26940c860a140b01dc772cf2378","RawContent":"&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.onlineweddingdeals.com\"&gt;Online Wedding Deals&lt;\/a&gt; \n \n By far the lowest price for my dress however it was suppose to take 12-14 weeks for delivery. Towards the end of the 14th week my order status had not changed on their website. They gave me some run around story and it wasn&#039;t until I emailed several more times that they shipped it and I rec&#039;d the dress at the end of the 15th week in a very tiny box. So in the end I got my dress for a great price- just a little more stress than I wanted to go through for my dress.\n Price A\n Customer Service- C","Attachments":[],"Id":320066,"PostDate":1212030726,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <a href='http:\/\/www.onlineweddingdeals.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Online Wedding Deals<\/a> <br \/> <br \/> By far the lowest price for my dress however it was suppose to take 12-14 weeks for delivery. Towards the end of the 14th week my order status had not changed on their website. They gave me some run around story and it wasn't until I emailed several more times that they shipped it and I rec'd the dress at the end of the 15th week in a very tiny box. So in the end I got my dress for a great price- just a little more stress than I wanted to go through for my dress.<br \/> Price A<br \/> Customer Service- C\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"courtneyryan1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1186100883,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207585.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"highheels","Id":207585,"Name":"highheels","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ad078222e4855558860f68359a02a86","RawContent":"HAS ANYONE ORDERED THEIR DRESS FROM HERE? I SAW ONE I ABSOLUTELY LOVE BUT IM WONDERING IF 