{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a2857e172c340788d71d2efa13f660da","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Seahagamy&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;My dress came from the USA and it arrived in 2.5 weeks.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I know this thread is a bit dated but I&#039;m glad to hear there have been good experiences with that site. They have beautiful dresses and I&#039;m thinking of ordering from there myself, though a bit apprehensive about it.\n \n Seahagamy - hope your wedding was wonderful!","Attachments":[],"Id":577219,"PostDate":1233336191,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Seahagamy<\/strong> <a href='\/forum\/post\/636370' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span><\/a>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">My dress came from the USA and it arrived in 2.5 weeks.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I know this thread is a bit dated but I'm glad to hear there have been good experiences with that site. They have beautiful dresses and I'm thinking of ordering from there myself, though a bit apprehensive about it.<br \/> <br \/> Seahagamy - hope your wedding was wonderful!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladeej721@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1231266501,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213641.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":37,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JC0721","Id":213641,"Name":"JC0721","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6aa6ae892b1e99a8d7ba398edbad6376","RawContent":"Great info on this thread thanks gals!","Attachments":[],"Id":577237,"PostDate":1233337108,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great info on this thread thanks gals!\r\n              <\/body>\