> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.75.178.29","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f3cd3a992616c12f433fd5a38bc4bd5a","RawContent":"[quote]\n\t[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278146-thebholders\/\"]TheBHolders[\/url]\nI will be staying at the reef in September. I can give you more info when I return[\/quote]\nI would love that this whole forum thing is very confusing to me so hopefully I see your comments. As for the grey linen we went with studio suits and they are amazing ordered a trial pair fit perfect then ordered the rest all great would totally recommend them.","Attachments":[],"Id":1869494,"PostDate":1409187776,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\">\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\t<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278146-thebholders\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>TheBHolders<\/span><\/a><\/span>\n<p>I will be staying at the reef in September. I can give you more info when I return<\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would love that this whole forum thing is very confusing to me so hopefully I see your comments. As for the grey linen we went with studio suits and they are amazing ordered a trial pair fit perfect then ordered the rest all great would totally recommend them.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"harmonyaj@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"206.75.178.29","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1397646107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277619.jpg?oh=51d5342d1529aeffeecae622f982df73&oe=53cbc5f7&__gda__=1406384677_103413454d73402acdb6668923c921a2","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AngelaIngram","Id":277619,"Name":"AngelaIngram","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.2.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c338def390414520405f85c2a0c766f2","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AngelaIngram\" post=\"1844877\" timestamp=\"1397713953\"]\nPlanning our wedding for Feb 2015 at the reef coco beach in Mexico as we wanted really small. Would love to know if anyone has been there, any helpful hints or wish I knew&#039;s. I am a photographer and have photographed and attended many destination weddings if i can help with anything for anyone else let me know. One thing we are struggling with is linen grey pants can&#039;t seem to find a light grey for reasonable any help appreciated.\n \nCheers[\/quote]We just got back from the reef coco beach and absolutely loved our stay. We liked it way better than Riu palace riviera maya \nWhat questions do you have?\n\nThe Italian and Mexican restaurants were delicious! The Miramar buffet was okay. We really just went for breakfast and ate lunch at the pool. Now the pool snack was delicious. Sandwiches, ribs, burgers, hot dogs, pizza, fries, salsas, guacamole, chicken, chicken wings. I want to go back just for the snack. \n\nOur room was good, smaller than Riu, no jacuzzi tub, but fine. Channel&#039;s were premium and in English. We watched alot of hbo. Staff is phenomenal.  They have a ballroom used for shows and a stage, it&#039;s a nice size. They didn&#039;t charge us for my fianc\u00e9&#039;s birthday cake and the matre d at Miramar said he had a gift for him at lunch time, but we left that day. I was surprised he knew because I made the cake arrangements with concierge.  We will definitely go back there. Cab to 5th Ave was $5. We walked around the neighborhood. This is a nice resort and not overwhelming","Attachments":[],"Id":1872806,"PostDate":1411467643,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>AngelaIngram, on 17 April 2014 - 01:52 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Planning our wedding for Feb 2015 at the reef coco beach in Mexico as we wanted really small. Would love to know if anyone has been there, any helpful hints or wish I knew's. I am a photographer and have photographed and attended many destination weddings if i can help with anything for anyone else let me know. One thing we are struggling with is linen grey pants can't seem to find a light grey for reasonable any help appreciated.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nCheers<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWe just got back from the reef coco beach and absolutely loved our stay. We liked it way better than Riu palace riviera maya <br \/>What questions do you have?<br><br>\nThe Italian and Mexican restaurants were delicious! The Miramar buffet was okay. We really just went for breakfast and ate lunch at the pool. Now the pool snack was delicious. Sandwiches, ribs, burgers, hot dogs, pizza, fries, salsas, guacamole, chicken, chicken wings. I want to go back just for the snack. <br><br>\nOur room was good, smaller than Riu, no jacuzzi tub, but fine. Channel's were premium and in English. We watched alot of hbo. Staff is phenomenal.  They have a ballroom used for shows and a stage, it's a nice size. They didn't charge us for my fianc\u00e9's birthday cake and the matre d at Miramar said he had a gift for him at lunch time, but we left that day. I was surprised he knew because I made the cake arrangements with concierge.  We will definitely go back there. Cab to 5th Ave was $5. We walked around the neighborhood. This is a nice resort and not overwhelming\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>So far 57 adult guests + bride and groom + 11 kids = 125 room nights. Focused on planning without stressing.","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401288470,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.75.178.29","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a51f2b5373d0058eafb496d04379bc37","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Perfect thank you! Did you notice if the club was open at night and going. Also is there beach a ok size our ceremony and reception are suppose to be on the beach but i hear it&#039;s really small.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872908,"PostDate":1411513453,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Perfect thank you! Did you notice if the club was open at night and going. Also is there beach a ok size our ceremony and reception are suppose to be on the beach but i hear it's really small.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"harmonyaj@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"206.75.178.29","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1397646107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277619.jpg?oh=51d5342d1529aeffeecae622f982df73&oe=53cbc5f7&__gda__=1406384677_103413454d73402acdb6668923c921a2","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AngelaIngram","Id":277619,"Name":"AngelaIngram","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.172.119.145","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8f0e63e10fe7db4b65b251654bad59ac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;the beach is extremely small. I guess there will be more space if they move the lounge chairs. There is also some beach space to the left of the resort. The beach near the resort really wasnt great, we walked further down for a few minutes to nicer beach. The beach in front of the resort has a pier and many boats outside, I didnt smell fuel like many TA reviews say. But there is some black plastic thing going along the beach &amp;nbsp;in the water and the water up to waist height is very sandy and therefore looks kind of brown. The beach in front of the resort is also very rocky and seemed to be seaweed haven. I did see them digging holes to bury the seaweed but it seemed inevitable. There is a beach club next door, they told us they close at 11, we didnt go back to check. There is also a sports bar on the resort that has a very club feel to it. It&#039;s very close to nightlife. Coco Maya is a beach club downtown and will do private events, the place is beautiful. PS. Wednesdays are ladys night at the club, so women are discounted to free at many clubs and bars. Ladies drink free at Fat Tuesdays on Tuesdays&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873394,"PostDate":1411728551,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>the beach is extremely small. I guess there will be more space if they move the lounge chairs. There is also some beach space to the left of the resort. The beach near the resort really wasnt great, we walked further down for a few minutes to nicer beach. The beach in front of the resort has a pier and many boats outside, I didnt smell fuel like many TA reviews say. But there is some black plastic thing going along the beach \u00a0in the water and the water up to waist height is very sandy and therefore looks kind of brown. The beach in front of the resort is also very rocky and seemed to be seaweed haven. I did see them digging holes to bury the seaweed but it seemed inevitable. There is a beach club next door, they told us they close at 11, we didnt go back to check. There is also a sports bar on the resort that has a very club feel to it. It's very close to nightlife. Coco Maya is a beach club downtown and will do private events, the place is beautiful. PS. Wednesdays are ladys night at the club, so women are discounted to free at many clubs and bars. Ladies drink free at Fat Tuesdays on Tuesdays<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>So far 57 adult guests + bride and groom + 11 kids = 125 room nights. Focused on planning without stressing.","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401288470,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"4.26.24.250","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e7acbf2c5b230a6514e5ef181243fce5","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TheBHolders\" post=\"1873394\" timestamp=\"1411742951\"]\nthe beach is extremely small. I guess there will be more space if they move the lounge chairs. There is also some beach space to the left of the resort. The beach near the resort really wasnt great, we walked further down for a few minutes to nicer beach. The beach in front of the resort has a pier and many boats outside, I didnt smell fuel like many TA reviews say. But there is some black plastic thing going along the beach  in the water and the water up to waist height is very sandy and therefore looks kind of brown. The beach in front of the resort is also very rocky and seemed to be seaweed haven. I did see them digging holes to bury the seaweed but it seemed inevitable. There is a beach club next door, they told us they close at 11, we didnt go back to check. There is also a sports bar on the resort that has a very club feel to it. It&#039;s very close to nightlife. Coco Maya is a beach club downtown and will do private events, the place is beautiful. PS. Wednesdays are ladys night at the club, so women are discounted to free at many clubs and bars. Ladies drink free at Fat Tuesdays on Tuesdays[\/quote]\nAbout how far down was the nice beach? We are leaving in 2 weeks for reef coco beach. Last time we came to PDC, we stayed at Ocean Maya Royale and walked down to a lagoon - we would love to find something like that again!","Attachments":[],"Id":1905323,"PostDate":1443087656,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TheBHolders, on 26 September 2014 - 10:49 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>the beach is extremely small. I guess there will be more space if they move the lounge chairs. There is also some beach space to the left of the resort. The beach near the resort really wasnt great, we walked further down for a few minutes to nicer beach. The beach in front of the resort has a pier and many boats outside, I didnt smell fuel like many TA reviews say. But there is some black plastic thing going along the beach \u00a0in the water and the water up to waist height is very sandy and therefore looks kind of brown. The beach in front of the resort is also very rocky and seemed to be seaweed haven. I did see them digging holes to bury the seaweed but it seemed inevitable. There is a beach club next door, they told us they close at 11, we didnt go back to check. There is also a sports bar on the resort that has a very club feel to it. It's very close to nightlife. Coco Maya is a beach club downtown and will do private events, the place is beautiful. PS. Wednesdays are ladys night at the club, so women are discounted to free at many clubs and bars. Ladies drink free at Fat Tuesdays on Tuesdays<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>About how far down was the nice beach? We are leaving in 2 weeks for reef coco beach. Last time we came to PDC, we stayed at Ocean Maya Royale and walked down to a lagoon - we would love to find something like that again!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"softballchica48@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"4.26.24.250","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442488567,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284847.jpg?_r=1444144941","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"sgleba25","Id":284847,"Name":"sgleba25","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.160.133.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2333e4cf2c3da89d0b38659195d663c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations and happy planning...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905622,"PostDate":1443550392,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations and happy planning...<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<div>\n<p><em><strong>Julian Molina<\/strong><\/em><\/p>\n<p><em><strong>Dj<\/strong><\/em><\/p>\n<p><b><i>Wedding Entertainment Consultant<\/i><\/b><\/p>\n<p><b><i>www.julianmolina.me<\/i><\/b><\/p>\n<p><b><i>Phone: +52 (998) 236 0134<\/i><\/b><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"julian.molina.info@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.185.71.164","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1274429146,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228415.jpg?_r=1443483879","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JwdEvents","Id":228415,"Name":"JwdEvents","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":16,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
