. The original design is from Sherri Hill, and i order in ivory-lavender blush colour. The dress arrive this afternoon, and i soo in love with it. \n\n\nI request an off-shoulder sleeves, and extra 3layer tulle to make it as puffy as the picture :D\n\n","Attachments":[],"Id":1902200,"PostDate":1439189624,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm pretty happy with the wedding dress i order from dresillyme before, so i decided to order a gown from them again. The original design is from Sherri Hill, and i order in ivory-lavender blush colour. The dress arrive this afternoon, and i soo in love with it. <br><br>\nI request an off-shoulder sleeves, and extra 3layer tulle to make it as puffy as the picture <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1902200]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-283866-0-36205400-1439203916.jpg\" title=\"aecabebc-cf63-423b-8836-23bb5d33449f-550-768.jpg - Size: 34.5KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-283866-0-36205400-1439203916.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"aecabebc-cf63-423b-8836-23bb5d33449f-550-768.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1902200]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-283866-0-48012300-1439203941.jpg\" title=\"IMG-20150810-WA0008_1.jpg - Size: 62.81KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" sr