{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1423584466,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f655017f02e78af7aa21e17e6326853","RawContent":"[quote name=\"perianjay\" post=\"1885919\" timestamp=\"1423598537\"]\nWhat fans?! tell me more.. lol[\/quote]I got the idea from @[member=\"calgarybride2015\"]. She got her fans for the ceremony from Michael&#039;s. They&#039;re pretty nice and if you get your hands on one of those 50% off one item coupons they come out to be at around $1 each! \n\nI always see them in the wedding section.\n\nI need about 4 boxes I think, so I&#039;m waiting for one of those and then going family shopping hahah.","Attachments":[],"Id":1885921,"PostDate":1423584287,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>perianjay, on 10 February 2015 - 04:02 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>What fans?! tell me more.. lol<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I got the idea from\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a>. She got her fans for the ceremony from Michael's. They're pretty nice and if you get your hands on one of those 50% off one item coupons they come out to be at around $1 each!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I always see them in the wedding section.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I need about 4 boxes I think, so I'm waiting for one of those and then going family shopping hahah.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.51.153.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":6,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8796ebc7bd64dee30991b60dcdfc4189","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Key card holders, wrist coils and message for inside have all been ordered!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can&#039;t wait to see how they turn out :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is how the insert will look. Vista Print had a promotion - 100 free business cards and just pay for shipping! My friend and I are splitting the order.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;If anyone is looking for a real touch flower shop with great prices, check out \"Stemple Shop\" on Etsy.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I love peonies..&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m putting in a pretty large order..&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-7 boutonnieres&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-2 Corsages&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-3 Bridesmaid Bouquets&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-1 Bridal Bouquet&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- 4 Small Bridal Bouquets&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I will be paying $168 with shipping!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Had to share :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885960,"PostDate":1423600140,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Key card holders, wrist coils and message for inside have all been ordered!<\/p>\n<p>Can't wait to see how they turn out <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1885960]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-80987900-1423614254.jpg\" title=\"IMG_9918.JPG -  73.73KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-80987900-1423614254.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_9918.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is how the insert will look. Vista Print had a promotion - 100 free business cards and just pay for shipping! My friend and I are splitting the order.\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p>If anyone is looking for a real touch flower shop with great prices, check out \"Stemple Shop\" on Etsy.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I love peonies..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1885960]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-96471800-1423614433.jpg\" title=\"il_570xN.642415776_h9uv.jpg -  38.6KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-96471800-1423614433.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"il_570xN.642415776_h9uv.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1885960]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-17574100-1423614461.jpg\" title=\"il_570xN.657800651_ehoz.jpg -  39.69KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-17574100-1423614461.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"il_570xN.657800651_ehoz.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm putting in a pretty large order..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>-7 boutonnieres<\/p>\n<p>-2 Corsages<\/p>\n<p>-3 Bridesmaid Bouquets<\/p>\n<p>-1 Bridal Bouquet<\/p>\n<p>- 4 Small Bridal Bouquets<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will be paying $168 with shipping!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Had to share <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.75.0.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1aa57ce1d4c34d792ce855fec2124dd4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"perianjay\" post=\"1885960\" timestamp=\"1423614540\"]\nKey card holders, wrist coils and message for inside have all been ordered!\nCan&#039;t wait to see how they turn out :)\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=30573\"]IMG_9918.JPG[\/url]\n\nThis is how the insert will look. Vista Print had a promotion - 100 free business cards and just pay for shipping! My friend and I are splitting the order. \n\nIf anyone is looking for a real touch flower shop with great prices, check out \"Stemple Shop\" on Etsy.\n\nI love peonies..\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=30574\"]il_570xN.642415776_h9uv.jpg[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=30575\"]il_570xN.657800651_ehoz.jpg[\/url]\n\nI&#039;m putting in a pretty large order..\n\n-7 boutonnieres\n-2 Corsages\n-3 Bridesmaid Bouquets\n-1 Bridal Bouquet\n- 4 Small Bridal Bouquets\n\nI will be paying $168 with shipping!\n\nHad to share :)[\/quote]That&#039;s an amazing price for real touch flowers! \n\nI love how the business cards look :) \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1885964,"PostDate":1423601573,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>perianjay, on 10 February 2015 - 08:29 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Key card holders, wrist coils and message for inside have all been ordered!<br>\nCan't wait to see how they turn out <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=30573' class='bbc_url' title=''>IMG_9918.JPG<\/a><br><br>\nThis is how the insert will look. Vista Print had a promotion - 100 free business cards and just pay for shipping! My friend and I are splitting the order. <br><br>\nIf anyone is looking for a real touch flower shop with great prices, check out \"Stemple Shop\" on Etsy.<br><br>\nI love peonies..<br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=30574' class='bbc_url' title=''>il_570xN.642415776_h9uv.jpg<\/a><br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=30575' class='bbc_url' title=''>il_570xN.657800651_ehoz.jpg<\/a><br><br>\nI'm putting in a pretty large order..<br><br>\n-7 boutonnieres<br>\n-2 Corsages<br>\n-3 Bridesmaid Bouquets<br>\n-1 Bridal Bouquet<br>\n- 4 Small Bridal Bouquets<br><br>\nI will be paying $168 with shipping!<br><br>\nHad to share <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThat's an amazing price for real touch flowers! <br><br>\nI love how the business cards look <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.51.153.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d013c8a60d09d1af60796e8a9efc65d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1885964\" timestamp=\"1423615973\"]\nThat&#039;s an amazing price for real touch flowers!\n\nI love how the business cards look :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]I thought so as well! I&#039;m so glad I found them. Thanks! \n\nFound the bridesmaid dresses and Bow ties! My bridesmaids all loved the idea of the &#039;convertible&#039; style dress. I found a great vendor on Etsy who makes them in all colours. My bridesmaids will be wearing coral..\n\n\nGroomsmen will be wearing coral bow-ties.. also found through an Etsy seller.\n\n\nAnd finally.. My FI&#039;s bow-tie (I really wanted to add a touch of mint here and there - so he will be wearing a mint bow-tie, white shirt, suspenders and a gray suit)","Attachments":[],"Id":1885971,"PostDate":1423606443,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 10 February 2015 - 08:52 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>That's an amazing price for real touch flowers!<br><br>\nI love how the business cards look <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I thought so as well! I'm so glad I found them. Thanks!\u00a0<\/p><br \/><p>Found the bridesmaid dresses and Bow ties! My bridesmaids all loved the idea of the 'convertible' style dress. I found a great vendor on Etsy who makes them in all colours. My bridesmaids will be wearing coral..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1885971]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-94942500-1423620758.jpg\" title=\"il_570xN.513382729_cd99.jpg -  80.29KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-94942500-1423620758.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"il_570xN.513382729_cd99.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Groomsmen will be wearing coral bow-ties.. also found through an Etsy seller.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1885971]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-86835200-1423620786.jpg\" title=\"il_570xN.641993165_1kka.jpg -  24.69KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-86835200-1423620786.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"il_570xN.641993165_1kka.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And finally.. My FI's bow-tie (I really wanted to add a touch of mint here and there - so he will be wearing a mint bow-tie, white shirt, suspenders and a gray suit)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1885971]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-03812700-1423620838.jpg\" title=\"il_570xN.499657606_qkh7.jpg -  38.01KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-03812700-1423620838.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"il_570xN.499657606_qkh7.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"54dd6833b1be53762c42555f49d5fc51","RawContent":"You ladies have inspired me to start going to Michaels! I&#039;ve already downloaded the app \n\n\n@[member=\"perianjay\"] I love that dress! Our colours are coral and grey. My MOH is the only one in coral and the bridesmaids are wearing grey. I&#039;ll show her the dress and see what she thinks. Oh and those flowers are great, especially for the price","Attachments":[],"Id":1886002,"PostDate":1423615528,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You ladies have inspired me to start going to Michaels! I've already downloaded the app <br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> I love that dress! Our colours are coral and grey. My MOH is the only one in coral and the bridesmaids are wearing grey. I'll show her the dress and see what she thinks. Oh and those flowers are great, especially for the price\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410084185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1441055220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.51.153.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9311b53268d3aef68fc7943173ad3341","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Wafflesmom\" post=\"1886002\" timestamp=\"1423629928\"]\nYou ladies have inspired me to start going to Michaels! I&#039;ve already downloaded the app\n\n@[member=\"perianjay\"] I love that dress! Our colours are coral and grey. My MOH is the only one in coral and the bridesmaids are wearing grey. I&#039;ll show her the dress and see what she thinks. Oh and those flowers are great, especially for the price[\/quote]Coral and Gray are such a great combo! That is going to look fantastic. The dress comes in different colour options so you may even be able to get it in gray as well :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1886003,"PostDate":1423618051,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Wafflesmom, on 11 February 2015 - 12:45 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>You ladies have inspired me to start going to Michaels! I've already downloaded the app<br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> I love that dress! Our colours are coral and grey. My MOH is the only one in coral and the bridesmaids are wearing grey. I'll show her the dress and see what she thinks. Oh and those flowers are great, especially for the price<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Coral and Gray are such a great combo! That is going to look fantastic. The dress comes in different colour options so you may even be able to get it in gray as well <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d5ca504789ae770432fb16f91737c48c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"perianjay\" post=\"1885960\" timestamp=\"1423614540\"]\nKey card holders, wrist coils and message for inside have all been ordered!\nCan&#039;t wait to see how they turn out :)\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=30573\"]IMG_9918.JPG[\/url]\n\nThis is how the insert will look. Vista Print had a promotion - 100 free business cards and just pay for shipping! My friend and I are splitting the order. \n\nIf anyone is looking for a real touch flower shop with great prices, check out \"Stemple Shop\" on Etsy.\n\nI love peonies..\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=30574\"]il_570xN.642415776_h9uv.jpg[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=30575\"]il_570xN.657800651_ehoz.jpg[\/url]\n\nI&#039;m putting in a pretty large order..\n\n-7 boutonnieres\n-2 Corsages\n-3 Bridesmaid Bouquets\n-1 Bridal Bouquet\n- 4 Small Bridal Bouquets\n\nI will be paying $168 with shipping!\n\nHad to share :)[\/quote]@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] i stil cant believe these flowers arent real!!! Ive been debating between buying rubber or fabric flowers but i wasnt likeing the look of each and this has completely blown me away!! and everything that your getting for 168!! Thank you so much for sharing this!","Attachments":[],"Id":1886081,"PostDate":1423666643,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>perianjay, on 10 February 2015 - 08:29 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Key card holders, wrist coils and message for inside have all been ordered!<\/p>\n<p>Can't wait to see how they turn out <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=30573' class='bbc_url' title=''>IMG_9918.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is how the insert will look. Vista Print had a promotion - 100 free business cards and just pay for shipping! My friend and I are splitting the order.\u00a0<\/p>\n<br><p>If anyone is looking for a real touch flower shop with great prices, check out \"Stemple Shop\" on Etsy.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I love peonies..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=30574' class='bbc_url' title=''>il_570xN.642415776_h9uv.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=30575' class='bbc_url' title=''>il_570xN.657800651_ehoz.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm putting in a pretty large order..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>-7 boutonnieres<\/p>\n<p>-2 Corsages<\/p>\n<p>-3 Bridesmaid Bouquets<\/p>\n<p>-1 Bridal Bouquet<\/p>\n<p>- 4 Small Bridal Bouquets<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will be paying $168 with shipping!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Had to share <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> i stil cant believe these flowers arent real!!! Ive been debating between buying rubber or fabric flowers but i wasnt likeing the look of each and this has completely blown me away!! and everything that your getting for 168!! Thank you so much for sharing this!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>57 Guest","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422618588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.51.153.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b5c5a050b7408109c4071a8ce69add9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"racht33\"] You&#039;re welcome. Thought i&#039;d pass it along since it was such a great deal :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886098,"PostDate":1423676118,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281952\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281952-racht33\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">racht33<\/span><\/a> You're welcome. Thought i'd pass it along since it was such a great deal <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d5a62e85fc4c584fa7303a8806063dcb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So I decided on a wedding band today and will be having my jeweller custom make it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I really wanted rose gold even though my E-Ring is white gold - I love the look of the mismatched gold.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I will be going with a french pave style, half eternity band. I want it to be a bit dainty since my E-Ring band is a bit thicker.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m really excited about how this is going to look with my e-ring.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886219,"PostDate":1423760116,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So I decided on a wedding band today and will be having my jeweller custom make it.<\/p>\n<p>I really wanted rose gold even though my E-Ring is white gold - I love the look of the mismatched gold.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will be going with a french pave style, half eternity band. I want it to be a bit dainty since my E-Ring band is a bit thicker.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1886219]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-42615800-1423774497.jpg\" title=\"49651_main.jpg -  42.21KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-42615800-1423774497.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"49651_main.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm really excited about how this is going to look with my e-ring.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.51.153.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aba7206a1ef97e5e434e5e08da4225f5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Cake Table&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m still deciding on this, but I know i&#039;d like to make my cake table the accent table. Tonight I found the cutest vintage votives and they were on sale! $4.90 and 40% off.. I couldn&#039;t resist, so I picked up three and plan to use them on the cake table. They are a bit taller than standard votive holders, so I may even use them as small vases.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886256,"PostDate":1423782314,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><u>Cake Table<\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm still deciding on this, but I know i'd like to make my cake table the accent table. Tonight I found the cutest vintage votives and they were on sale! $4.90 and 40% off.. I couldn't resist, so I picked up three and plan to use them on the cake table. They are a bit taller than standard votive holders, so I may even use them as small vases.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1886256]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-13421200-1423796701.jpg\" title=\"20150212_220100.jpg -  57.76KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-13421200-1423796701.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"20150212_220100.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1012,"TotalPages":102,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":1010},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
