member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> those large votive look great with the flowers. And the price is right too! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410084185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1441055220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ebf01441c7cc0d7833483cfdefff4c1c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"perianjay\" post=\"1886386\" timestamp=\"1423959303\"]\nSo I decided that I wanted to fill those pretty vintage silver votive holders with a small bouquet of flowers and use them on the cake table..\nI found some artificial flowers at Dollarama.. (what?! I know - but they actually look really nice, surprisingly).\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=30618\"]20150214-804238284.jpg[\/url]\n\nI had bought four bunches for $1.00 a piece and since they were pretty large bunches and I didn&#039;t need the entire thing for the votive holders, I decided to use them for my Bride and Groom chairs (with MRS. &amp;amp; MR sign).\n\n[b]My inspiration photo: [\/b]\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=30619\"]674ce7bdae312ed26040ba3398a2f85f.jpg[\/url]\n\n[b]The small chair bouquets..[\/b]\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=30620\"]20150214851250595.jpg[\/url][\/quote]What!? those flowers look great! Who would know that they were from the dollar store. I love the idea for the Mr. and Mrs. chairs :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1886409,"PostDate":1424009553,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>perianjay, on 14 February 2015 - 08:15 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>So I decided that I wanted to fill those pretty vintage silver votive holders with a small bouquet of flowers and use them on the cake table..<\/p>\n<p>I found some artificial flowers at Dollarama.. (what?! I know - but they actually look really nice, surprisingly).<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=30618' class='bbc_url' title=''>20150214-804238284.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I had bought four bunches for $1.00 a piece and since they were pretty large bunches and I didn't need the entire thing for the votive holders, I decided to use them for my Bride and Groom chairs (with MRS. & MR sign).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>My inspiration photo:\u00a0<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=30619' class='bbc_url' title=''>674ce7bdae312ed26040ba3398a2f85f.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>The small chair bouquets..<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=30620' class='bbc_url' title=''>20150214851250595.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>What!? those flowers look great! Who would know that they were from the dollar store. I love the idea for the Mr. and Mrs. chairs <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.219.69.226","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6980fc0903de0998d142736be597f87b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"perianjay\" post=\"1885960\" timestamp=\"1423614540\"]\nKey card holders, wrist coils and message for inside have all been ordered!\nCan&#039;t wait to see how they turn out :)\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=30573\"]IMG_9918.JPG[\/url]\n\nThis is how the insert will look. Vista Print had a promotion - 100 free business cards and just pay for shipping! My friend and I are splitting the order. \n\nIf anyone is looking for a real touch flower shop with great prices, check out \"Stemple Shop\" on Etsy.\n\nI love peonies..\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=30574\"]il_570xN.642415776_h9uv.jpg[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=30575\"]il_570xN.657800651_ehoz.jpg[\/url]\n\nI&#039;m putting in a pretty large order..\n\n-7 boutonnieres\n-2 Corsages\n-3 Bridesmaid Bouquets\n-1 Bridal Bouquet\n- 4 Small Bridal Bouquets\n\nI will be paying $168 with shipping!\n\nHad to share :)[\/quote]That&#039;s awesome I will definitely check that out!\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1886457,"PostDate":1424041625,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>perianjay, on 10 February 2015 - 08:29 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Key card holders, wrist coils and message for inside have all been ordered!<br>\nCan't wait to see how they turn out <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=30573' class='bbc_url' title=''>IMG_9918.JPG<\/a><br><br>\nThis is how the insert will look. Vista Print had a promotion - 100 free business cards and just pay for shipping! My friend and I are splitting the order. <br><br>\nIf anyone is looking for a real touch flower shop with great prices, check out \"Stemple Shop\" on Etsy.<br><br>\nI love peonies..<br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=30574' class='bbc_url' title=''>il_570xN.642415776_h9uv.jpg<\/a><br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=30575' class='bbc_url' title=''>il_570xN.657800651_ehoz.jpg<\/a><br><br>\nI'm putting in a pretty large order..<br><br>\n-7 boutonnieres<br>\n-2 Corsages<br>\n-3 Bridesmaid Bouquets<br>\n-1 Bridal Bouquet<br>\n- 4 Small Bridal Bouquets<br><br>\nI will be paying $168 with shipping!<br><br>\nHad to share <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThat's awesome I will definitely check that out!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim 