{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":12,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":944,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1903633,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284593,"Name":"AngDima","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284593.jpg?_r=1442000140","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1440768176,"LastPoster":{"Id":262240,"Name":"MissAmber26","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262240.jpg?_r=1421980656","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1905635,"PostDate":1443574246,"PostContent":"Guess where I'm going in December  ? \u00a0I'll scope it out for you if you want! So excited for this...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theniylife@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.228.60.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430537880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"1weddingirl","Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.228.47.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79543,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"362cfd6453979c26208984d1c489673f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"MissAmber26\" post=\"1905114\" timestamp=\"1442805946\"]\nThanks @[member=\"1weddingirl\"] I eventually got the answer from travel agent and I did do a group contract. Mine is 6th room free for every 5. I&#039;m at Hyatt Ziva Cancun[\/quote]Guess where I&#039;m going in December :D ?  I&#039;ll scope it out for you if you want! So excited for this much needed vacation.","Attachments":[],"Id":1905635,"PostDate":1443574246,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MissAmber26, on 20 September 2015 - 08:25 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282948\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282948-1weddingirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">1weddingirl<\/span><\/a> I eventually got the answer from travel agent and I did do a group contract. Mine is 6th room free for every 5. I'm at Hyatt Ziva Cancun<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Guess where I'm going in December <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> ? \u00a0I'll scope it out for you if you want! So excited for this much needed vacation.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theniylife@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.228.60.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430537880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"1weddingirl","Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.209.228.111","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79543,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87692fe2071644ab08a8446707caa495","RawContent":"[quote name=\"1weddingirl\" post=\"1905635\" timestamp=\"1443570646\"]\nGuess where I&#039;m going in December :D ?  I&#039;ll scope it out for you if you want! So excited for this much needed vacation.[\/quote]\nReally??? So jealous! Yes please do check it out and get photos for me! I&#039;m hoping to go in Jan but won&#039;t know if I can until my fianc\u00e9 gets back (he&#039;s in the navy and at sea until late Nov). Thanks so much!","Attachments":[],"Id":1905645,"PostDate":1443583659,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>1weddingirl, on 29 September 2015 - 04:50 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Guess where I'm going in December <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> ? \u00a0I'll scope it out for you if you want! So excited for this much needed vacation.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br>\nReally??? So jealous! Yes please do check it out and get photos for me! I'm hoping to go in Jan but won't know if I can until my fianc\u00e9 gets back (he's in the navy and at sea until late Nov). Thanks so much!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Amaqt03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"98.169.122.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1352514105,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262240.jpg?_r=1421980656","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissAmber26","Id":262240,"Name":"MissAmber26","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79543","Title":"Has Anyone Ever Got Married At Hyatt Ziva Rose Hall Jamaica","LastPostDate":1443583659},"Pages":{"TotalItems":12,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
